LOCATION:SIDNEY AND LOIS ESKENAZI MUSEUM OF ART
GEO:39.169144;-86.519739
SUMMARY:Summer Art Camp: Creating with Nature
DESCRIPTION:Each day of the nature-inspired week includes hands-on projec
 ts like painting\, printmaking\, sculpture\, and mixed media\, along with
  fun outdoor exploration (weatherpermitting). By the end of the week\, st
 udents will have a collection of artwork celebrating the beauty and inspi
 ration of the natural world.  Art lessons and activities are thoughtfully
  designed and led by our licensed art educator.  Drop-off and pick-up inf
 ormation will be shared via email after registration.12-3 pm Monday - Fri
 day.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW75914810 B
 CX0">Each day of the nature-inspired week includes hands-on projects like
  painting\, printmaking\, sculpture\, and mixed media\, along with fun ou
 tdoor exploration (weather</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW75914810 
 BCX0">permitting</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW75914810 BCX0">). B
 y the end of the week\, students will have a collection of artwork celebr
 ating the beauty and inspiration of the natural world.</span></p><p data-
 start="0" data-end="90">  Art lessons and activities are thoughtfully des
 igned and led by our licensed art educator.</p><p data-start="92" data-en
 d="169" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">  Drop-off and pick-up 
