SUMMARY:CREATE: Creative Block Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Want to learn how to move past creative block?Join usfor a fr
 ee 4-week workshop series to help unstick your creativity.Led by the Eske
 nazi Museum of Art's licensed art therapist\, you'll learn ways to reduce
  burnout\, find inspiration from the world around you\, and build creativ
 ity back into your life. Supplies are provided\, and all skill levels are
  welcome!  This workshop runs 4 consecutive weeks\, and each week builds 
 on the previous one\; therefore\, we ask that you only sign up if you can
  commit to attending a majority of the sessions. If you have questions\, 
 please feel free to email Keaton Evans-Black\, the Museum's Arts-Based We
 llness Experiences Manager.  Session Dates are as follows:July 1st\, 3:30
 pm - 5pm  July 8th\, 3:30pm - 5pm  July 15th\, 3:30pm - 5pm  July 22nd\, 
 3:30pm - 5pm
